OL,3,GNEWSACat survives after month stuck in
OL,4,Adead man's home
OL,5,
OL,6,FRescuers were relieved she had managed
OL,7,Fto keep herself alive by getting inside
OL,8,Fa large bag of cat food and drinking
OL,9,Fwater from the toilet. The group said
OL,10,Fithe cat "somehow, against all the
OL,11,Fodds", it survived for about a month,
OL,12,Fbut it worried that other cats may be
OL,13,Fat similar risk.
